  "body": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"ko\"> <table class=\"infobox\" style=\"width:22em\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold\"><div style=\"position:relative; width:100%; height:38px; display:table; background:#4C6099;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; right:0;\"></div><span style=\"position:relative; width:100%; display:table-cell; vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; color:#FFFFFF\">시흥 하나님의 교회</span></div></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center\"><div class=\"church-thumb\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a class=\"mw-file-description\" href=\"/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5_%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C.jpg\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-height=\"716\" data-file-width=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"286\" src=\"https://churchofgod.wiki/images/thumb/0/0e/%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5_%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C.jpg/330px-%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5_%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C.jpg\" width=\"320\"/></a><figcaption>시흥 하나님의 교회 전경</figcaption></figure></div><div><div style=\"padding-top:1pt; padding-bottom:5pt;\"></div></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"width:23%;\">유형</th><td>교회</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"width:23%;\">목적</th><td>예배, 복음전파, 사회봉사</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"width:23%;\">위치</th><td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/bt82i3MdtuQHFJYF7\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">경기도 시흥시</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"width:23%;\">소속</th><td><a href=\"/%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C_%EC%84%B8%EA%B3%84%EB%B3%B5%EC%9D%8C%EC%84%A0%EA%B5%90%ED%98%91%ED%9A%8C\" title=\"하나님의교회 세계복음선교협회\">하나님의교회 세계복음선교협회</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"width:23%;\">웹사이트</th><td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://watv.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">watv.org</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"width:23%;\">유튜브채널</th><td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@wmscog_ko\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">하나님의 교회 공식 유튜브</a></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"position:relative; width:100%; height:2px; display:table; background:#DEE6E9;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; right:0;\"></div><span style=\"position:relative; width:100%; display:table-cell; vertical-align:middle; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98:%EA%B5%AD%EB%82%B4_%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\" title=\"분류:국내 교회\">국내 하나님의 교회</a></span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"position:relative; width:100%; height:2px; display:table; background:#DEE6E9;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; right:0;\"></div><span style=\"position:relative; width:100%; display:table-cell; vertical-align:middle; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98:%ED%95%B4%EC%99%B8_%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\" title=\"분류:해외 교회\">해외 하나님의 교회</a></span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"position:relative; width:100%; height:2px; display:table; background:#DEE6E9;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; right:0;\"></div><span style=\"position:relative; width:100%; display:table-cell; vertical-align:middle; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98:%EC%B4%9D%ED%9A%8C_%EA%B8%B0%EA%B4%80\" title=\"분류:총회 기관\">총회 기관</a></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>시흥 하나님의 교회</b>는 경기도 시흥시에 세워진 교회다. 2012년 12월 1일에 헌당기념예배를 거행했다. 정식 명칭은 하나님의교회 세계복음선교협회 시흥교회다.\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"ko\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">목차</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#개관\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">개관</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#특색\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">특색</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#참조\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">참조</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#각주\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">각주</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"개관\"><span id=\".EA.B0.9C.EA.B4.80\"></span>개관</h2></div>\n<ul><li>헌당: 2012년 12월 1일</li>\n<li>규모: 지하 1층, 지상 4층, 연면적 1780㎡</li>\n<li>시설: 대예배실, 소예배실, 교육실, 다목적실, 식당 외</li>\n<li>위치: 경기도 시흥시</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"특색\"><span id=\".ED.8A.B9.EC.83.89\"></span>특색</h2></div>\n<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.doopedia.co.kr/doopedia/master/master.do?_method=view&amp;MAS_IDX=101013000735448\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">시화국가산업단지</a>가 조성된 <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.siheung.go.kr/main.do\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">시흥시</a>에서 시흥 하나님의 교회는 시민들과 근로자들에게 마음의 안식처 역할을 한다. 예배와 선교 같은 교회 본연의 역할은 물론, <a href=\"/%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5%EC%A0%95%EC%99%95_%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\" title=\"시흥정왕 하나님의 교회\">시흥정왕 하나님의 교회</a> 등 인근 교회와 연합하여 헌혈릴레이, 소외이웃돕기를 포함한 봉사활동으로 그리스도의 사랑을 실천한다.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.siheung.go.kr/portal/contents.do?mId=0801010500\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">물왕호수</a>, <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.siheung.go.kr/portal/contents.do?mId=0801010000\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">오이도</a>, <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.siheung.go.kr/portal/contents.do?mId=0801050000\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">갯골생태공원</a> 등 관광지가 많은 지역 특성을 감안하여 깨끗하고 건강한 환경을 보존하기 위한 정화활동에도 힘쓰고 있다.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"참조\"><span id=\".EC.B0.B8.EC.A1.B0\"></span>참조</h2></div>\n<ul><li><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.kyeongin.com/main/view.php?key=695503\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">시흥 하나님의교회 헌당기념예배 가져</a>. 《경인일보》. 2012. 12. 3.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%EA%B2%BD%EC%9D%B8%EC%9D%BC%EB%B3%B4&amp;rft.atitle=%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C+%ED%97%8C%EB%8B%B9%EA%B8%B0%EB%85%90%EC%98%88%EB%B0%B0+%EA%B0%80%EC%A0%B8&amp;rft.chron=2012.+12.+3.&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.kyeongin.com%2Fmain%2Fview.php%3Fkey%3D695503&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span><br/></li>\n<li><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://news.watv.org/internal/content.asp?articleid=i20121201827\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">시흥교회 헌당기념예배</a>. 《하나님의교회 세계복음선교협회 홈페이지》.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C+%EC%84%B8%EA%B3%84%EB%B3%B5%EC%9D%8C%EC%84%A0%EA%B5%90%ED%98%91%ED%9A%8C+%ED%99%88%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80&amp;rft.atitle=%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C+%ED%97%8C%EB%8B%B9%EA%B8%B0%EB%85%90%EC%98%88%EB%B0%B0&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fnews.watv.org%2Finternal%2Fcontent.asp%3Farticleid%3Di20121201827&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"각주\"><span id=\".EA.B0.81.EC.A3.BC\"></span>각주</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.kyeongin.com/main/view.php?key=20180417010007300\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">시흥권 하나님의 교회 '유월절사랑 헌혈릴레이'</a>. 《경인일보》. 2018. 4. 18.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%EA%B2%BD%EC%9D%B8%EC%9D%BC%EB%B3%B4&amp;rft.atitle=%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5%EA%B6%8C+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C+%27%EC%9C%A0%EC%9B%94%EC%A0%88%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91+%ED%97%8C%ED%98%88%EB%A6%B4%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%27&amp;rft.chron=2018.+4.+18.&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.kyeongin.com%2Fmain%2Fview.php%3Fkey%3D20180417010007300&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%8B%9C%ED%9D%A5+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.segyenewsagency.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=379898\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=